divergence: Ipe.Core.Jwt flat kernels (encodeHs256/decodeHs256) are the Rust-backend M5b interim surface; the Go backend exposes only the builder API (Jwt.encode / decode), so this exact program does not compile on the Go reference. Ipe records its own output. Divergence from Ipe, rationale: JWT API-surface interim (docs/architecture/divergence-policy.md).
